message: "If you use poa, please cite it as below."
title: "poa: plant organelle annotator"
abstract: >-
  Gene annotation of plant mitochondrial and plastid genomes, with
  RNA-editing-aware gene models, spliced and trans-spliced genes, and GFF3
  output on contigs and assembly-graph unitigs.
type: software
authors:
